page('sources','Sources, evidence & privacy boundaries','<p>Official pages below were retrieved and read during this session on 11 November 2026. This is a targeted verification of the curated release, not certification of every line in the preserved legacy repository. Links in hypothetical rows support context, not their fictional inputs.</p>'+table(['Publisher / topic','Evidence checked','Status'],[(link(k),e({'sco':'California estate-return and historical inheritance-tax dates','prop13':'1% base levy, bonded debt, assessment growth cap and reassessment','ftb':'Inheritance receipt vs subsequent taxable income','boe':'Principal residence, claims timing, value-limit framework','estate':'2026 exclusion, gross estate, lifetime gifts, portability','new':'Public Law 119-21 and 2026 exclusion','basis':'Inherited basis and later sale gains','ins':'Comparison tools; FAIR Plan limitations','insavg':'Statewide average homeowner premium (context only, not a property quote)','cpi':'December 2022 annual CPI and electricity changes','court':'Estate inventory, authority and transfer process','adjust':'Cost basis, improvements and depreciation','mlr':'1979-81 annual inflation 11.3% / 13.5% / 10.3%','fhfa':'Statewide purchase-only prices -20.8% over four quarters; national -6.0%','cbo':'Baseline convention: inflation consistent with 2% from 2027; uncertainty ranges published','usgs':'72% probability of magnitude 6.7+ within 30 years (regional)','cdib':'January 2025 fires: about 4 billion dollars estimated FAIR Plan loss; 1-billion-dollar assessment approved','sec':'Diversification across and within asset categories; risk and cost principles'}[k]),'Retrieved and read') for k in S])+ '<h2>Verification contract</h2><p>Verified means the stated general rule was checked in retrieved official text, not that a private property figure was verified. Unverified values are blank, not zero. Analysis, assumptions, formulas and stress tests have separate labels. Monetary illustrations are rounded to $10; no external analytics, forms, trackers, libraries or personal-data requests are used.</p><h2>Deployment boundary</h2><p>Only this allowlisted directory is uploaded to Pages. Legacy research trees, data, coordination logs and repository files are excluded. A noindex request is not access control. The public repository and previous commits remain a privacy risk; a private planning tool would be safer for actual financial inputs.</p>')
P.joinpath('style.css').write_text('''*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f5f7fa;color:#182d40;font:16px/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif}header{background:#102b3b;color:#fff;padding:22px 4%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}header span,.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.6px;font-weight:700}.brand{color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;font-size:20px}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px minmax(0,1fr);max-width:1550px;margin:auto}nav{padding:30px 18px}nav a{display:block;padding:11px 16px;text-decoration:none;color:#40596c;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}nav a:hover,nav a[aria-current]{background:#deecea;color:#006456;font-weight:700}main{padding:38px 40px 70px;min-width:0}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);letter-spacing:-1.5px;line-height:1.2;margin:14px 0 22px}h2{font-size:21px;margin-top:30px}.eyebrow{color:#08796a}.lead{font-size:19px;max-width:900px;color:#4e6475}.notice{border-left:4px solid #08796a;background:#e7f2ee;padding:22px;border-radius:6px;margin:26px 0}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.cards article{background:white;padding:20px;border:1px solid #dce4ea;border-radius:12px}.cards h2{margin:0}.scroll{overflow:auto;border:1px solid #dce4ea;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;margin:20px 0}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px}th{text-align:left;background:#edf2f5;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}th,td{padding:16px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ebef}td:first-child{font-weight:650;min-width:150px}a{color:#006d66;text-underline-offset:3px}td:last-child{min-width:145px}footer{margin-top:45px;border-top:1px solid #dce4ea;padding-top:20px;font-size:12px;color:#536775}.button{display:inline-block;background:#08796a;color:white;border-radius:7px;padding:11px 20px;text-decoration:none}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d77913;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:850px){.layout{display:block}nav{display:flex;overflow:auto;padding:12px}nav a{white-space:nowrap}main{padding:22px 18px}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}header span{display:none}}''')
